European Investment-Grade Bond Etfs: 

Xtrackers Euro Corporate Bond ETF (XECB)
- Tracks the iBoxx Euro Corporates Index, providing broad exposure to investment-grade, euro-denominated corporate bonds across various sectors.

Lyxor Euro Corporate Bond ETF (CRPR)
- Follows the Bloomberg Barclays Euro Corporate Bond Index, offering access to high-quality European corporate bonds with regular rebalancing.

iShares Euro Corporate Bond ETF (IBCX)
- Tracks a comprehensive index of euro-denominated investment-grade corporate bonds with diversified sector exposure.

SPDR Bloomberg Euro Corporate Bond ETF (SYBC)
- Provides exposure to investment-grade euro-denominated corporate bonds by following the Bloomberg Euro Corporate Bond Index.

Amundi Euro Corporate Bond ETF (AEUC)
- Follows the Markit iBoxx EUR Liquid Corporates Index, focusing on liquid, high-quality euro-denominated corporate bonds.

Vanguard Euro Corporate Bond ETF (VECP)
- Tracks the Bloomberg Barclays Euro Corporate Bond Index, offering a low-cost option with broad exposure to investment-grade European corporate bonds.

UBS Bloomberg Euro Corporate Bond 1-5 Year ETF (UC1E)
- Focuses on shorter-term euro-denominated corporate bonds with 1-5 year maturities, reducing interest rate sensitivity.

European High-yield bonds: 

iShares Euro High Yield Corporate Bond ETF (IHYG)
Provides exposure to euro-denominated high-yield bonds with lower credit ratings, offering higher return potential but also higher risk.

SPDR Bloomberg Euro High Yield Bond ETF (SYBJ)
Tracks the Bloomberg Euro High Yield Bond Index, including high-yield bonds from European companies with lower credit ratings.

Lyxor Euro High Yield ETF (HEU)
Invests in euro-denominated high-yield bonds, creating a portfolio with higher risk but potentially higher returns.

Xtrackers Euro High Yield Corporate Bond ETF (XEHY)
Follows the Markit iBoxx EUR Liquid High Yield Index, which includes liquid, high-yield corporate bonds across sectors in Europe.

